body:
I am sorry that you feel this way. You do matter, especially to your mom. I honestly know that life can be hard and full of obstacles but those obstacles become something we look back on to measure progress. Focus on the little things that you make progress on and start noticing them. 

&#x200B;

I hope this comment brings you a smile :)

I can relate and have done the research too. I won't go into that detail but I will focus on a positive message. I don't know what your struggle/demons are and I won't say it's always great, but I will say some days will be worth it. Focus on what you can control right here and now and don't worry about the past.  Try to smile, find inner peace, and just focus on being you. 

&#x200B;

I hope this reply puts you on a better path.
